  <item>
    <title>Ep.15 相亲世界里，到底有正常人吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6499db60d6cdb597286d8750</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6499db60d6cdb597286d8750</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Jun 2023 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果要我列出不想长大的原因，排在第一的是：讨厌相亲；排在第二的是：讨厌相亲但是又不得不相亲。身边很多人都在相亲市场里迷失了方向，从最初想要寻找爱，慢慢演变成想要寻找到杰出的相亲对象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是！成年人的世界里没有容易两个字！那些相亲对象一次次给予我们灵魂的冲击，或诡异，或犀利，或挑衅，或卑鄙。在此郑重呼吁，我们只是相亲而已，还不熟，麻烦做个人吧……</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小程：小红书/抖音/b站@小程不烦</span></p><span></span><p><span>门师傅：小红书/抖音/b站@门腔</span></p><span></span><p><span>小范：小红书@Fancyyyyyy1122</span></p><span></span><p><span>老杨：那个年代的人没有社交账号</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 只有结婚为目的的见面才算相亲吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 外婆烧香的佛友，为小范指点姻缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> 揭秘小程和门师傅的相亲全过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 朋友介绍比家人介绍更不靠谱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> 居然有人会喜欢流水席相亲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 网络姻缘一线牵，社交平台来捉奸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 交友软件也有鄙视链？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 恋爱综艺的剧本太明显啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 乘风破浪的姐姐，训练有素的相亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 婚姻再大，也大不过原则性问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> 各路网友奇葩经历大放送，槽点太密集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2214">36:54</a> 老杨太太，最近总喜欢一个人在小房间看视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a> 小范相亲记1：见面后立刻换装改变ootd</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 小范相亲记2：为什么要吃我碗里的东西？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3027">50:27</a> 小范相亲记3：猥琐！猥琐！猥琐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a> 老杨相亲记1：被日料背刺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3490">58:10</a> 小范相亲记4：生而为人，你有边界感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3616">01:00:16</a> 老杨相亲记2：第一次听说！相亲要带这个？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3917">01:05:17</a> 老杨相亲记3：成功了，结婚！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4160">01:09:20</a> 第一次相亲就牵手算赶进度吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4295">01:11:35</a> 相亲市场有风险，入市需谨慎</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luVjnPBQlMzdKNncFRo7ESWkftxC.m4a" length="75187930" type="audio/mp4"/>
