  <item>
    <title>Ep.12 是谁一直被绿，还这么开心？！(上)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647e154c53a5e5ea14f68fe8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647e154c53a5e5ea14f68fe8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Jun 2023 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>众所周知，人一旦相信爱情，就很容易被绿。幸福的爱情大抵是相同的，而发现被绿的情况却各有各的精彩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天除了两位主播和听友们分享的被出轨经历之外，还特别邀请来两位很要好的朋友，一起哭诉，不是，一起开心地分享自己被绿的事迹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小标题：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 欢迎被绿的两位新嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 市面上畅销的被出轨方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 健身房碰到外婆在动感单车上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 第一道绿光：被看到了，我就轻松了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 第二道绿光：人在新西兰，照片背景在澳大利亚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> 第三道绿光：脚骨折，用出轨治好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 第四道绿光：对象社交平台官宣和别人在一起了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 第五道绿光：他们这么懒，凭什么能出轨？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a> 第六道绿光：出轨的人造谣我出轨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a> 第七道绿光：背叛了我两次，我更爱TA了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1967">32:47</a> 小程的绿光：我陪你上课，你陪人睡觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> 门师傅的绿光：我是贫穷，他是贵公子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 嘉宾的第一道绿光是大S和陈慧琳一起给的</span></p><span></span><p><span>未完待续……</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnqbQvrqkNn-8VK1ZMQ23XST5o0a.m4a" length="53871227" type="audio/mp4"/>
