  <item>
    <title>Ep.11 不和陌生人睡觉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647060ae53a5e5ea1422085a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647060ae53a5e5ea1422085a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 May 2023 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期所说的内容是我们两个对于爱情的观点！</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以观点就是仅代表个人的，主观的。它不能代表所有人，更不适用所有人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们对彼此很依恋，但也保持个体的独立。我们经常在同一个空间里，做自己喜欢的事情，互不打扰。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 情绪价值太太太重要了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 爱情让我们变成了另外一个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> 求求男人千万不要“爹”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 不能接受枕边人是陌生人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a> 不要做爱情里的聋子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 小程曾经爱到迷失自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a> 谈一场互相尊重的爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a> 幸好我们都有爱别人的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">27:27</a> 我们欣赏花时间的爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a> 我们眼里都很有活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> 去看见，也是很棒的能力！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll73hDoNF9YHYLbwUQirzoWF16SK.m4a" length="36575563" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZuMU56VDNXUko1SFRQVXhfdzdwRS1PelpSTTkucG5n.png"/>
