  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.10 脱口秀大会，很难上吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6457c748306513184c4fc967</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6457c748306513184c4fc967</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 May 2023 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这个节目很难上吗？太难了！太难了！太难了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>小程说这一期要走点心，聊一下我的另一个身份，也就是脱口秀演员。那就再次自我介绍一下，我是一名笑果的签约演员——门腔。其实我讲脱口秀也才2年不到，就浅浅给大家分享一下心得体会吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>然后……然后！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个春天，我们共同经历的一个盛大的折磨人的腥风血雨的比赛（当然看比赛的人不会有这种感觉）——全称是《全国脱口秀大赛TIGHT5-脱口秀大会第六季直通赛》。这个比赛里，有节目上名声在外的大咖们，和他们同台竞技是什么体验呢？答案就在这期节目里！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvibw3mEpYA048qonAwkj_Z9dnMy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a> 门师傅的起步是无知和自大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> 如何平衡脱口秀和本职工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a> 签约笑果的来龙去脉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> 创作太难了！无论短视频还是脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> 幽默的人不等于能讲好脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1059">17:39</a> 不能骗观众，会被发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> tight5！侥幸进了全国10强！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 两个人边吃锅贴边哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1663">27:43</a> 现在回想比赛还是紧张刺激!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> 压轴太难了，梗都睡了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2419">40:19</a> 我是有点贱，有点蠢，外加很loser</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a> 门师傅还会精益求精的，共勉吧！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llWsBWfD3a1v2-0eU74CbARacCRq.m4a" length="42318828" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnN1FxNlJwNDlKU1NyUU1tam1ZQU5iazVWUXcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.9 我们再也不想上班了，因为失业三个月！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64526b2594d78eb3f7fe9f66</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64526b2594d78eb3f7fe9f66</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 May 2023 14:09:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>士别三月，小程和门师傅都失业啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次我们就聊自己对于失业的感受，带大家沉浸式走入无业游民的内心世界。分享失业前中后的心路历程，以及这段日子的消费水平。</span></p><span></span><p><span>很多槽点，相信大家都会有共鸣的，欢迎评论区分享职场的糟心事，我们一起不吐不快！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 失业很好，不用焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> 每一个HR都不是很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 没有办法面对被裁的同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 老板确实很有问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> HR还有灰色收入吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 细数辞职原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a> 感觉身体被掏空</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1621">27:01</a> 从事4年时尚，我依旧不理解时尚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 应该换一种生活方式了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">37:27</a> 还原辞职现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2564">42:44</a> 老板认为自己是无敌的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2882">48:02</a> 辞职前后消费状况对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3248">54:08</a> 人还是要靠push</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljbaXJRtCSyoE5bz4Bx_GOx1AyHD.m4a" length="64227981" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqOFkzOTdrVXFsVjk4SlVaTk53SlhKa0JfLTUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.8 你正在遭受不公吗？巧了，我也是！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640989dc092eb63cb0305cd7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640989dc092eb63cb0305cd7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Mar 2023 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi！好久不见听友们，我是门师傅，久等了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次拖了这么久才更新，都是我的责任，因为我的生活遭遇了很大的变故，期间被各种不公平来回冲刷我的信念，把我的心情踩碎在地上摩擦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以才有“不公平”为主题的这一期，让我们血压升高，然后再互相取暖吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">1:50</a> 门师傅受够了！本命年勇敢裸辞！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">6:26</a> 遭遇职场不公的真人真事投稿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a> 感情案例投稿——新加坡男友搭上离异房姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 感情案例投稿——“我已经甩掉女朋友了，富婆请好好爱我”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">22:14</a> 感情案例投稿——妈妈和女友掉水里，我先救兄弟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1737">28:57</a> 不公平！妈妈说胖小孩不能吃肉！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a> 为什么人的一生就是在被比较？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2234">37:14</a> 回归家庭的，一定非得是女人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2386">39:46</a> 一些提高生育率的小建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2662">44:22</a> “那个女人，她活该！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2818">46:58</a> 谈谈自己的中年危机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3171">52:51</a> 面对不公平，可以怎么做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3436">57:16</a> “失望是有限的，而希望是无限的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3638">01:00:38</a> 原来友情这么伤……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3912">01:05:12</a> 开心一点吧，不然会变丑！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lumOyIKBgP5PcN4TD_Rw_9FZACaR.m4a" length="66103320" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1VnRJU2o0SE1QS1ZaQmRrVjRaYTZkcVEwRFIucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.7 这辈子戒不了狗了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634e93d22a992d56e91e6179</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">634e93d22a992d56e91e6179</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Oct 2022 11:53:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不是小狗需要人类，而是人类需要小狗；对我们来说，小狗可以陪伴我们十几年，而对小狗来说，我们可是他的一生，好好爱他吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> 养一只搜救缉毒工作犬（史宾格）是什么体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 为什么放弃他？他那么美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> 比格受害者联盟的告诫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> “胡迪”的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 没事不要去宠物医院，会哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> 养狗17年的经验之谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a> 买狗东西买疯了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 小奶狗不乖？训他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2698">44:58</a> 是我们养狗还是狗养我们？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3019">50:19</a> 出离愤怒？不存在的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3256">54:16</a> 做条招财狗吧！胡迪！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3444">57:24</a> 希望狗子自己有足够的审美</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgAplq28NPFm9_2DSpFMEo2Pe_MV.m4a" length="60815317" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnWXhUb0tob2JkMUtzVkRENVR3SVN6TV9PTXQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.6 这是我们的月经，有什么问题吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63319cd92a992d56e91e508f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63319cd92a992d56e91e508f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Sep 2022 12:36:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我看到的不成体统的话，如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“一所房子中女人们在的那一侧，即没有知识的那一侧。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“打鸣的母鸡和懂拉丁文的女人从来没有好结果。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>女性好像如果不低下的话，男性就高大不起来一样。力量和勇气不仅是男性的特权，我希望女性可以呐喊，GIRLS HELP GIRLS 即使人言可畏！在成为好女儿，好妻子，好妈妈之前，首先我们是我们自己！女性不仅能自己发光，也能照亮别人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 卫生巾是日常必需品，高铁凭什么不提供售卖？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 因为赵韦航、杜英哲，"老师"被污名化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> “我没有婚外情，我只是越了界”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 男生只需要60分，女生需要90分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> 职场上单身女性性格有问题，单身男性一心拼事业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 可以教女性如何提防陌生人，但不能让女性害怕穿裙子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1183">19:43</a> 父母希望女儿是好妻子好妈妈，并不期待女儿做自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 那些小气恶毒的男性们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 男人说“我坐高铁从来没碰到过突然来月经的女人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a> 男性喜欢看女性雌竞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2338">38:58</a> 荡妇羞辱伴随疯婆羞辱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 被骚扰、被性侵的女性从来就不可耻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2713">45:13</a> 日常生活中逃离女性困境的措施</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2915">48:35</a> 去成为自己，比什么都重要</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpQdzN5iXUWqJf65657D6PyQRcG6.m4a" length="47669333" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1Ujg5SC1iUS1pV3pnZDR1cTlmVU9hLTByRDgucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.5 我被无孔不入的尴尬击败了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6327081caafc5c394512dec2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6327081caafc5c394512dec2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Sep 2022 11:59:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当代社会人总能用生活里的尴尬集锦，筑起了一个强大的帝国，当尴尬与生活浑然天成时，那可是令人尖叫的程度呢～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> 男友妈妈帮我收好了情趣内衣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> 热恋少女的鲁莽经血</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 浪漫晚宴变成了散伙饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 男医生说“就是这个感觉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 帅哥走向我，脸红心跳大娇喘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 全公司人都看到了我的内裤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">20:32</a> 在公共场合唱歌，千万不要闭眼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">27:39</a> 热恋期间，在男友生日时当众社死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1901">31:41</a> 管别人两口子的闲事会被反噬的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2084">34:44</a> 因为丁字裤，女朋友和我分了手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a> 女友闷头备孕，男友不见踪影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2641">44:01</a> 摆脱尴尬情绪，以下几点亲测有效</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkp--8mrxVk6BgUYUGtQcG80iW-H.m4a" length="44559098" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z0ZUF5czBLd2dUeW5lRkVtUWNsY210ajN2SXMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.4 比鬼更可怕的，是下头男女</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631d441490e867995c093774</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">631d441490e867995c093774</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Sep 2022 02:12:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>生活中或男女间常常有一些荷尔蒙跳崖的瞬间，我们称为下头！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你的日常中有碰到那些个恶心事，那说明世界来救你了，赶紧他妈的逃！必须远离那些蛤蟆打点滴，没事硬装人的人类！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> “你想要，你自己买”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 年下男跟姐姐说：“我饿了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> EX请我吃饭，买完单跟我说“下一次你来”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> “我妈说了一句话你别生气”——妈宝男如实说。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a> 别拿我和别人比较，我怕输</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 海王只想群发，没想到变成群聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> 我是双鱼座，所以你要陪我演戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> “我虽然和TA在一起，但我最爱你”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> 你所谓的开玩笑，就是在开黄腔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> 爹味浓=喜当爹？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">30:13</a> 普信男走到哪里都能开课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 对服务员凶，以后就会对你凶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 诋毁前任的人，你千万要注意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> 送礼物还能画大饼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 现在穿工字背心，也有伤风化了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a> 我辞职了，因为老板让我背了个大包</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2894">48:14</a> 世界名校毕业生，宣称女生不用学很多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3107">51:47</a> 我被色狼猥亵，家人说：“谁让你穿裙子！”</span></p>]]></description>
