  <item>
    <title>Ep.3 道歉大会：原来这30多年我对不起了那么多人？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/630e3ca443274df80456cc8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">630e3ca443274df80456cc8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Aug 2022 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在漫漫一生中我们会对不起一些人，我们道歉，你们跪下听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有啦哈哈哈哈哈…</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们就是带着诚挚歉意苟活的过错方。毕竟东欧剧变了，苏联解体了，人生也没什么好动气的啊！原谅我们吧，如果你们听得到的话。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 常在河边走，哪有不挨揍？！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> 20年前，我邂逅过一个阿飘</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a> 虽然对不起妈妈，可是男一和男二都走了…</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a> 酒店风云之黑道大哥爱上我</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a> 门师傅洗香香，我说hold on hold on！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">39:19</a> 姑娘们，让我们独自美丽吧～</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a> 朋友圈是多少友情的坟墓？</span></blockquote>]]></description>
