  <item>
    <title>Ep.2 恋爱脑：前任、马思纯和激增30厘米的男人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6304df36761895ce11cc07a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6304df36761895ce11cc07a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Aug 2022 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>呵呵，爱情这杯酒，还真是上头；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你不爱我没关系，我爱你就好；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你不是人没关系，我可以把你幻想成神；</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们不管身处什么环境与谁发生感情连结，爱他人的同时记得爱自己，当两者无法兼顾时，记得选择爱自己！毫无疑问！本来世间也没有那么多疼痛文学，那是部分人谋名谋利才造出来的，很多疼痛你感同身受也是因为你没有那么爱自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱是美好的，美好的前提必须是双向奔赴的，不是只是委屈一方放低姿态，双方是要共同成长，并且是往一个方向去的，如果觉得他不爱你，尽快结束这段关系！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 恋爱脑到底是什么东西？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 紫薇你怎么在这里？！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a> 关于小程前男友的未解之谜</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> 小程妈妈slay全场</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 好笑不好笑，我命由他不由我</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">15:33</a> 恋爱脑配拥有幸福吗？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a> 别人恋爱，我们没必要当爹当妈</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 门师傅锐评马思纯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 爆笑十分钟，关于激增30cm的男人</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1979">32:59</a> 恋爱脑需要挂号吗？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a> 爱是超能力，call me by your name</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> “你爱我吗？”“滚！”</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr3ETb5o7rOo0yhyTNRD5vTTNiNN.m4a" length="42447452" type="audio/mp4"/>
